cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Trustworthy Stock Intelligence"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Chien-Hsun Chang"
repository-code: "https://github.com/KageRyo/trustworthy-stock-intelligence"
url: "https://github.com/KageRyo/trustworthy-stock-intelligence"
license: "Apache-2.0"
version: "0.8.0"
date-released: "2026-10-09"
abstract: >-
  Research software for schema-first, human-in-the-loop stock drawdown-risk
  analysis with temporal validation, calibration, uncertainty, trust scores,
  warning explanations. Version 0.8.0 adds a Taiwan institutional-flow and
  margin data path with a walk-forward experiment that found no gain, so the
  served baseline keeps the 0.7.0 range-volatility features; it also localizes
  trust and freshness summaries and bounds concurrent on-demand analyses. It is
  not externally validated research or investment advice.
keywords:
  - stock risk
  - trustworthy AI
  - calibration
  - uncertainty estimation
  - temporal validation
  - financial machine learning
